#### 2. 结论与证明逻辑对应关系

1. **单分量结论（推论第一式）**：
   - **正文**：
     $$\bigcup_{\substack{q\in\mathcal P\\ j\in I_{\mathrm{res}}(q)}}U_{q,j}(\tau_j) \subseteq \{x\in U:d_j(\phi(x),\phi^\natural(x))\leq\tau_j\}.$$
   - **Lean（[`path_component_guarantee_union_subset_proxy_error`](file:///private/tmp/math-gauge-v060-argon-gcp-20261110/attempts/AHR04/physical-1/session/work/formal_oet/vol_03/ch_14_empirical_network_fitting/path_guarantee_domains.lean#L520-L545)）**：
     ```lean
     {x | ∃ q : N.ReachablePath,
       j ∈ path_evaluable_components N sample q ∧
       x ∈ path_component_empirical_guarantee_domain d
         (fun i j => Lq q i j + Lstar i j) N sample q j
         (path_empirical_residual_upper d target N sample delta_o q j) tau}
       ⊆ {x | x ∈ N.U ∧ d j (proxy.func x) (target.func x) ≤ tau}
     ```
   - **证明对应**：任取左侧元素 $x$ 及见证路径 $q$，由 [`N.path_domain_subset_source`](file:///private/tmp/math-gauge-v060-argon-gcp-20261110/attempts/AHR04/physical-1/session/work/formal_oet/vol_01/ch_05_operator_networks/operator_network.lean#L768-L771) 得 $x \in U_q \subseteq U$；再调用命题 `#h-4b5219aa3a3bbdad` 的代理保证域形式 [`proxy_path_component_guarantee_error_bound`](file:///private/tmp/math-gauge-v060-argon-gcp-20261110/attempts/AHR04/physical-1/session/work/formal_oet/vol_03/ch_14_empirical_network_fitting/path_guarantee_domains.lean#L152-L174)，直接推出 $d_j(\phi(x), \phi^\natural(x)) \le \tau_j$。

2. **联合分量族结论（推论第二式）**：
   - **正文**：
     $$\bigcup_{\substack{q\in\mathcal P\\ J\subseteq I_{\mathrm{res}}(q)}} U_{q,J}(\boldsymbol\tau) \subseteq \{x\in U:\forall j\in J,\ d_j(\phi(x),\phi^\natural(x))\leq\tau_j\}.$$
   - **Lean（[`path_joint_guarantee_union_subset_proxy_error`](file:///private/tmp/math-gauge-v060-argon-gcp-20261110/attempts/AHR04/physical-1/session/work/formal_oet/vol_03/ch_14_empirical_network_fitting/path_guarantee_domains.lean#L553-L582)）**：
     ```lean
     {x | ∃ q : N.ReachablePath,
       J ⊆ path_evaluable_components N sample q ∧
       x ∈ path_joint_empirical_guarantee_domain d
         (fun i j => Lq q i j + Lstar i j) N sample q J
         (path_empirical_residual_upper d target N sample delta_o q) tau}
       ⊆ {x | x ∈ N.U ∧
         ∀ j : I, j ∈ J → d j (proxy.func x) (target.func x) ≤ tau j}
     ```
   - **证明对应**：任取左侧元素 $x$ 及见证路径 $q$，由 `N.path_domain_subset_source` 得 $x \in U$；对任意 $j \in J$，利用 [`path_chain_eq_represented_proxy_on_path`](file:///private/tmp/math-gauge-v060-argon-gcp-20261110/attempts/AHR04/physical-1/session/work/formal_oet/vol_03/ch_14_empirical_network_fitting/path_sampling.lean#L220-L231) 将 $c_q(x)$ 替换为 $\phi(x)$，并调用 [`path_joint_guarantee_error_bound`](file:///private/tmp/math-gauge-v060-argon-gcp-20261110/attempts/AHR04/physical-1/session/work/formal_oet/vol_03/ch_14_empirical_network_fitting/path_guarantee_domains.lean#L210-L236) 得到 $d_j(\phi(x), \phi^\natural(x)) \le \tau_j$。

